    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/2fef8e1c8cf633d04bd7809572423681.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/2fef8e1c8cf633d04bd7809572423681.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/2fef8e1c8cf633d04bd7809572423681.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Invite friends to your guild and expand your fish store empire together. Occasionally, a new group of fish will drop in the &quot;Local Fish Store&quot;. Every single fish is unique, so there are a limited number of fish in the game. This also means fish can go extinct! Use this to your advantage... try to build a monopoly on a single species of fish!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/57badd1273b386a025eeb04bbf59e93f.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/57badd1273b386a025eeb04bbf59e93f.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/57badd1273b386a025eeb04bbf59e93f.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can balance your tank's ecosystem by having just the right amount of light, nutrients, and CO2. This means fewer water changes and less cleaning. Have newly bred fish go straight to the store, and collaborate with your friends (and guild) to care for a tank. Go run your dream automated, fish-selling, $$$-making fish store!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/0143db911eaade7860fa64896d5e9789.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/0143db911eaade7860fa64896d5e9789.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/0143db911eaade7860fa64896d5e9789.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Some fish are hardy, and some are delicate. To create the optimal environment to breed healthy fish to sell, you must cultivate plants, fine tune water parameters, and feed premium fish foods. Earn currency for each fish or plant your guild sells, then use it to buy more fish species to expand your stock. You can also sell fish to institutions, like the Biology Lab, as long as you breed them up to their standards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/4bac3d1ed94566acf4b07081114ec8e4.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/4bac3d1ed94566acf4b07081114ec8e4.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/4bac3d1ed94566acf4b07081114ec8e4.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/316823f45099b63ecfb7ec559a99181a.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/316823f45099b63ecfb7ec559a99181a.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/316823f45099b63ecfb7ec559a99181a.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use a beautifully arranged and aquascaped tank to market your fish and increase sales as other players scroll through the &quot;Local Fish Store&quot;. Or, submit a tank to a design competition to win currency. Choose from a wide variety of real plants, hardscape, and livestock!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/19b3277815c3ffa4d8c2212122e0dca7.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/19b3277815c3ffa4d8c2212122e0dca7.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/19b3277815c3ffa4d8c2212122e0dca7.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/2fef8e1c8cf633d04bd7809572423681.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/2fef8e1c8cf633d04bd7809572423681.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/2fef8e1c8cf633d04bd7809572423681.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Invite friends to your guild and expand your fish store empire together. Occasionally, a new group of fish will drop in the &quot;Local Fish Store&quot;. Every single fish is unique, so there are a limited number of fish in the game. This also means fish can go extinct! Use this to your advantage... try to build a monopoly on a single species of fish!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/57badd1273b386a025eeb04bbf59e93f.poster.avif?t=1717730529\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/57badd1273b386a025eeb04bbf59e93f.webm?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2547020/extras/57badd1273b386a025eeb04bbf59e93f.mp4?t=1717730529\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>You can balance your tank's ecosystem by having just the right amount of light, nutrients, and CO2. This means fewer water changes and less cleaning. Have newly bred fish go straight to the store, and collaborate with your friends (and guild) to care for a tank. Go run your dream automated, fish-selling, $$$-making fish store!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted lo